WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.958 --> 00:00:03.867
"Read [the [beta] guide](…)." is "Read the [beta] guide.", "the [beta] guide" a link

2
00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:06.765
An unbalanced [ is text; in [a [b](…) c](…) only b is a link

3
00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:09.670
A code span still binds tighter than the link's text: "[the `[beta` guide](…)": its unbalanced [ in code, still a link
